hookah-dump-verb = Dump contents
hookah-dump = You dump all of the hookah's contents onto the floor.
hookah-event-smoke = The hookah suddenly releases a huge cloud of smoke!
hookah-event-coal = The coal flares brighter than usual and nearly singes your eyebrows.
hookah-event-bubbles = The hookah answers with an especially important and convincing gurgle.
hookah-event-hose = The hose makes a suspicious sloshing sound.
